{"title": "Dirty Disturbed Masked", "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"druid-infobox druid-container noexcerpt\" id=\"druid-container-1\"><div><div class=\"druid-title\">Dirty Disturbed Masked</div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div class=\"druid-main-image\"><div class=\"druid-main-images-labels druid-tabs\"><div class=\"druid-main-images-label druid-tab druid-toggleable druid-title-tab focused\" data-druid=\"1-1\" data-druid-tab-key=\"In-Game\">In-Game</div></div><a href=\"/wiki/File:Dirty_Disturbed_Masked.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Dirty Disturbed Masked.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/Dirty_Disturbed_Masked.jpg/250px-Dirty_Disturbed_Masked.jpg?93ddc1\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"141\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Dirty_Disturbed_Masked.jpg/375px-Dirty_Disturbed_Masked.jpg?93ddc1 1.5x, /images/thumb/Dirty_Disturbed_Masked.jpg/500px-Dirty_Disturbed_Masked.jpg?93ddc1 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-Information\">Information</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-VariantOf\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-VariantOf\">Variant Of</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-VariantOf druid-data-nonempty\">\nMasked</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-InternalID\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-InternalID\">Internal ID</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-InternalID druid-data-nonempty\">\nDirtyDisturbedMasked<br />PlayerEnemy</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-MaxCount\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-MaxCount\">Max Count</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-MaxCount druid-data-nonempty\">\n10</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-PowerLevel\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-PowerLevel\">Power Level</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-PowerLevel druid-data-nonempty\">\n1</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-CauseofDeath\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-CauseofDeath\">Cause of Death</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-CauseofDeath druid-data-nonempty\">\nStrangulation</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-IsBodyRecoverable\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-IsBodyRecoverable\">Is Body Recoverable?</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-IsBodyRecoverable druid-data-nonempty\">\nNo</div></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-Stats\">Stats</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Health\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Health\">Health</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Health druid-data-nonempty\">\n4</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Damage\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Damage\">Damage</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Damage druid-data-nonempty\">\nInstant Kill</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-DoorSpeedMultiplier\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-DoorSpeedMultiplier\">Door Speed Multiplier</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-DoorSpeedMultiplier druid-data-nonempty\">\n2</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-StunTimeMultiplier\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-StunTimeMultiplier\">Stun Time Multiplier</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-StunTimeMultiplier druid-data-nonempty\">\n0.75</div></div></div></div>\n<p>The <b>Dirty Disturbed Masked</b> is a hostile entity and variant of the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://lethal.miraheze.org/wiki/Masked\">Masked</a> added by <b>Wesley's Ememy Variants</b>. It is an employee with a <b>Dirty disturbed</b> mask attached to their face.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Mechanics\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Mechanics\">&gt; Mechanics</span></h2>\n<p>Identical to a regular Masked, the <b>Dirty Disturbed Masked</b> will roam around in search of players. It looks similar to a normal player on the radar but will often be seen spinning around. It will look around, sprint, and stop sprinting randomly. If no player is within the interior, it will try to reach the main entrance and exit onto the exterior and vice versa. It will also make its way to the ship after some time to hide and wait for players to return to ambush them.\n</p><p>If a <b>Dirty Disturbed Masked</b> spots a player, it will pause before beginning to chase them. If a player comes into contact with it, they'll be grabbed and the <b>Dirty Disturbed Masked</b> will try to convert them. This can be interrupted if the <b>Dirty Disturbed Masked</b> is hit. Otherwise, the player will die, their body and any scrap they were holding can not be recovered, and a second <b>Dirty Disturbed Masked</b> will spawn.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Spawn_Conditions\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Spawn_Conditions\">&gt; Spawn Conditions</span></h2>\n<p>An initial <b>Dirty Disturbed Masked</b> will only be spawned if a player wears and randomly gets possessed by the <b>Dirty disturbed</b> scrap that is a potential <a href=\"/wiki/Toy_Store#Rewards\" title=\"Toy Store\"><b>Secondary Objective Reward</b></a> from the <b>Toy Store</b>.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Audio\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Audio\">&gt; Audio</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noresize\">\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"text-align: center;\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<caption style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">Audio\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Action</th>\n<th>Sound\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Grabbing</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"6\" data-mwtitle=\"MaskAttackPlayer.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/MaskAttackPlayer.mp3?ec3e3b\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/MaskAttackPlayer.mp3/MaskAttackPlayer.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mask Lighting Up</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"1\" data-mwtitle=\"MaskFaceLightUp.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/MaskFaceLightUp.mp3?acf05e\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/MaskFaceLightUp.mp3/MaskFaceLightUp.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Puking</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"4\" data-mwtitle=\"MaskPuke.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/MaskPuke.mp3?37ec49\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/MaskPuke.mp3/MaskPuke.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Gallery\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Gallery\">&gt; Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:DirtyDisturbedGrab.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"The Dirty Disturbed Masked grabbing a player.\"><img alt=\"The Dirty Disturbed Masked grabbing a player.\" src=\"/images/thumb/DirtyDisturbedGrab.jpg/120px-DirtyDisturbedGrab.jpg?13e0f7\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/DirtyDisturbedGrab.jpg/180px-DirtyDisturbedGrab.jpg?13e0f7 1.5x, /images/thumb/DirtyDisturbedGrab.jpg/240px-DirtyDisturbedGrab.jpg?13e0f7 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">The Dirty Disturbed Masked grabbing a player.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:DirtyDisturbedCorpse.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"The corpse of the Dirty Disturbed Masked.\"><img alt=\"The corpse of the Dirty Disturbed Masked.\" src=\"/images/thumb/DirtyDisturbedCorpse.jpg/120px-DirtyDisturbedCorpse.jpg?8ab174\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/DirtyDisturbedCorpse.jpg/180px-DirtyDisturbedCorpse.jpg?8ab174 1.5x, /images/thumb/DirtyDisturbedCorpse.jpg/240px-DirtyDisturbedCorpse.jpg?8ab174 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">The corpse of the Dirty Disturbed Masked.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n</ul></div>", "images": ["Dirty_Disturbed_Masked.jpg", "DirtyDisturbedGrab.jpg", "DirtyDisturbedCorpse.jpg", "MaskAttackPlayer.mp3", "MaskFaceLightUp.mp3", "MaskPuke.mp3"], "cats": ["Pages_with_DRUID_infoboxes"]}